            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "compression": -1,
            "text": "/*******************************/\r\n/********* bubbletip ***********/\r\n/*******************************/\r\n.bubbletip\r\n{\r\n\tposition: absolute;\r\n\tz-index: 50;\r\n\tborder-collapse: collapse;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip:hover\r\n{\r\n    z-index: 1000;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-topleft\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip.png) no-repeat scroll 0px 0px;\r\n\theight: 33px;\r\n\twidth: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-top\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip-T-B.png) repeat-x scroll 0px 0px;\r\n\theight: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-topright\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip.png) no-repeat scroll -73px 0px;\r\n\theight: 33px;\r\n\twidth: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-left-tail div.bt-left, .bubbletip td.bt-left\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip-L-R.png) repeat-y scroll 0px 0px;\r\n\twidth: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-left-tail div.bt-left-tail\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip.png) no-repeat scroll 0px -33px;\r\n\twidth: 33px;\r\n\theight: 40px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-right-tail div.bt-right, .bubbletip td.bt-right\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip-L-R.png) repeat-y scroll -33px 0px;\r\n\twidth: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-right-tail div.bt-right-tail\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip.png) no-repeat scroll -73px -33px;\r\n\twidth: 33px;\r\n\theight: 40px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-bottomleft\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip.png) no-repeat scroll 0px -73px;\r\n\theight: 33px;\r\n\twidth: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-bottom\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip-T-B.png) repeat-x scroll 0px -33px;\r\n\theight: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-bottomright\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip.png) no-repeat scroll -73px -73px;\r\n\theight: 33px;\r\n\twidth: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip table.bt-top, .bubbletip table.bt-bottom\r\n{\r\n\twidth: 100%;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip table.bt-top th\r\n{\r\n\twidth: 50%;\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip-T-B.png) repeat-x scroll 0px 0px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip table.bt-bottom th\r\n{\r\n\twidth: 50%;\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip-T-B.png) repeat-x scroll 0px -33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip table.bt-top td div\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip.png) no-repeat scroll -33px 0px;\r\n\twidth: 40px;\r\n\theight: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip table.bt-bottom td div\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: transparent url(/adiJed/img/bubbletip.png) no-repeat scroll -33px -73px;\r\n\twidth: 40px;\r\n\theight: 33px;\r\n}\r\n.bubbletip td.bt-content\r\n{\r\n\tbackground-color: #fff;\r\n\tvertical-align: middle;\r\n}\r\n/*******************************/\r\n\r\n"
